# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`IIXX`, `IIXZ`, `IIZZ`, `IZXZ`, `IXXZ`, `ZZXZ`, `XZXZ`, `ZIXZ`, `ZZZZ`, "
